ica, parteciperà al concorso scientifico indetto per tutte le scuole della nazione; e vincerà il primo premio anche grazie al padre, che gli procurò i pezzi che gli erano stati rubati durante il concorso. Il suo ultimo razzo lo dedicò alla professoressa Riley, morta di morbo di Hodgkin."},{"id":102221,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":6618,"locale":"it","key":"release_date","value":"1999-02-19"},{"id":102220,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":6618,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"cielo-dottobre"},{"id":102223,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":6618,"locale":"it","key":"views","value":"21243"}],"keywords":[{"id":74,"name":"based on novel or book","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:55.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":74}},{"id":159,"name":"small town","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:08.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":159}},{"id":625,"name":"biography","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:51:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:51:48.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":625}},{"id":801,"name":"parent child relationship","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:52:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:52:42.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":801}},{"id":1427,"name":"teacher","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:51.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":1427}},{"id":1628,"name":"1950s","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:56:50.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:56:50.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":1628}},{"id":3065,"name":"satellite","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:04:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:04:58.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":3065}},{"id":3251,"name":"west virginia","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:06:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:06:11.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":6618,"keyword_id":3251}},{"id":5668,"name":"coal mine","created_at":"